fixture wall_cling_regrip
doc BUILD.md s5 Wall-cling "slide at 180 u/s for up to 90 f, then normal fall": letting go for a frame and gripping again does not restart the 90 frames
room test/shaft
spawn 760 100
frames 200
input
  0..80 R
  81 -
  82..199 R
end
expect
  mark cling 0..20 event.wall_cling=1
  at 81 state=air
  # The re-grip continues the slide: 91 frames on the wall in all (the cling frame and 90 of
  # sliding), the same as one unbroken cling, then the fall.
  at 82 event.wall_cling=1 wall_frames=75
  at cling+91 state=wall
  never cling+92..199 state=wall
end
